meric text cannot be entered/saved. Valid value 7 was accepted and saved, shown as \\\"7\\\" in the table.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Due Date is input[type=date]. Entering the invalid calendar date 02/31/2026 left the input value empty with validity.badInput=true, so it could not be committed. A valid date 2026-03-11 was accepted and saved, rendered as \\\"Mar 11, 2026\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Before/after sorting by Task Name and Priority the count stayed \\\"6 entries\\\" and every row kept identical field values (e.g. Alpha QA test task | 7 | Mar 11, 2026 | checked | Zoe Meyer | 42; entry-2 | 2 | Jan 18, 2026 | checked | — | —). Only row order changed.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Cannot verify filter inclusion/clearing — no filtering capability\", \"actual\": \"The app provides no filter criteria UI (see FT-6), so there is no way to apply active criteria or clear them. Only a global quick-search exists, which is not field-specific filtering.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"All 6 entries and all 6 field values render in both views with matching content (e.g. entry-2: Review marketing materials / 2 / Jan 18, 2026 / checked / — / —). Empty values render as an em dash \\\"—\\\" in both table and card views.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Add Entry dialog renders input[type=text] for Task Name, input[type=number] for Priority, input[type=date] for Due Date, and a labeled Yes/No toggle button for Completed; each field is labeled with its name.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Entry form: toggle button reads \\\"No\\\" (unchecked) vs \\\"Yes\\\" (ch